WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
A red sun rises, blood has been spilled this night

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:10.080
This forest is old... very old

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.320
Aarrghh! A scout!

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.520
What's happening out there?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.000
Shall I describe it to you, or would you like me to find you a box?

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.240
Hahaha

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:43.260
I feel something, a slight tingle in my fingers, I think it's affecting me

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.660
It still only counts as one!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.500
They're taking the hobbits to Isengard!

